  <div class="darkmoderotate" id="noticebox-header" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #a5b1bd; color:#000000">This is a sprite extracted from a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Copyright" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:en:Copyright">copyrighted</a> computer or video game.</div>
